<%# Test-only layout. It renders the picker THE WAY AN APP DOES — from the
    layout, because that is where both consuming apps mount the modal host.
    That timing is the whole point: rendered during the LAYOUT pass,
    view_flow[:layout] already holds the captured page body, so a partial that
    yields into it leaks that body into the card. Rendered from the TEMPLATE the
    flow is still empty and nothing can leak, which is how the first version of
    this probe went inert and passed with the defect restored. %>
<div id="probe-host"><%= render "solana_studio/modals/wallet_connect" %></div>
<%= yield %>
